    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102298" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τᾰναύπους</span></b>  (i.e. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τανάϝπους</span>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταναός</span>),
